WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.010
- We're back y'all, celebrating
women doing big things

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:04.810
in the world of sports ball.

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:07.700
As a reporter for ESPN
and now for FOX Sports.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.110
Our first guest has been front and center

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.950
at some of the biggest sports
ball events in the world.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:16.350
She's an ambassador for FOX's
free streaming service, Tubi

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:18.040
